<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - Rahma Pearl Girls PG</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.0.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background-color: #fdfdfd; }
        .about-header { background: #6c5ce7; color: white; padding: 60px 0; text-align: center; }
        .stat-box { border-radius: 15px; padding: 20px; background: white; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="about-header">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold">About Rahma Pearl</h1>
            <p class="lead">Dedicated to providing the safest environment for women.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container py-5">
        <div class="row align-items-center mb-5">
            <div class="col-md-6">
                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">Our Mission</h2>
                <p class="text-muted">Rahma Pearl Girls PG was established to solve the accommodation challenges faced by female students and professionals. We believe that a comfortable home is the foundation of success.</p>
                <p class="text-muted">We don't just provide a room; we provide a community where safety, hygiene, and comfort are our top priorities.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 text-center">
                <i class="fas fa-hand-holding-heart fa-10x text-primary opacity-25"></i>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="row text-center g-4">
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <h2 class="text-primary fw-bold">100+</h2>
                    <p class="mb-0">Residents</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <h2 class="text-primary fw-bold">24/7</h2>
                    <p class="mb-0">Security Support</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-4">
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <h2 class="text-primary fw-bold">5-Star</h2>
                    <p class="mb-0">Hygiene Rating</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="text-center mt-5">
            <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline-primary rounded-pill px-4">Back to Home</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>